      "caption": "Ingredients (4 Servings) Chicken: * 1½ lbs chicken thighs, cubed * 1 tsp paprika * 1 tsp garlic powder * ½ tsp salt * ½ tsp black pepper * 1 tbsp olive oil Honey Garlic Sauce: * ⅓ cup honey * ¼ cup soy sauce * 4 garlic cloves, minced * 1 tbsp rice vinegar * 1 tbsp cornstarch * 2 tbsp water Rice & Garnish: * 2 cups cooked jasmine rice * Green onions * Sesame seeds  Instructions: 1️⃣ Cook the Chicken (8 Minutes) Heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Season chicken with: * paprika * garlic powder * salt * pepper Cook 6–8 minutes until golden brown and cooked through. 2️⃣ Make the Sauce (3 Minutes) In a bowl combine: * honey * soy sauce * garlic * rice vinegar Pour into skillet. Mix cornstarch and water separately, then add to skillet. Cook 2–3 minutes until thick, sticky, and glossy. 3️⃣ Assemble (2 Minutes) Add rice to serving bowls. Top with sticky honey garlic chicken. Garnish with: * green onions * sesame seeds #easyrecipe #foodrecipe #dinnerideas #quickmeals #foodtiktok ",
