      "caption": "🛒 Ingredients: Chicken: \t•\t6 chicken thighs \t•\tOnion powder \t•\tGarlic powder \t•\tCajun seasoning \t•\tBlack pepper \t•\tPaprika \t•\tItalian herbs \t•\tOlive oil (for searing) Sauce: \t•\t2 tbsp butter \t•\t2 tbsp fresh minced garlic \t•\t½ cup chicken broth 👩🏽‍🍳 How to Make It: \t1.\tSeason chicken thighs with all dry seasonings to taste. \t2.\tSear in olive oil on both sides until golden, then set aside. \t3.\tIn the same skillet, melt butter and sauté garlic until fragrant. \t4.\tPour in chicken broth and stir well. \t5.\tReturn chicken to pan, cover, and simmer 15–20 mins until tender and juicy. \t6.\tServe over mashed potatoes, rice, or pasta. Spoon on extra sauce and enjoy the compliments! #MarryMeChicken #TikTokDinner #DateNightDinner #FoodieFaves #EasyDinnerIdeas",
